      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُلْكَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلَكٌ</span>: ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  and see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُلَكَةٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3- 
Also <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُكْلَةٌ</span>: (K:) formed from the latter by
transposition: so in the saying, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى لِسَانِهِ حُلْكَةٌ</span>
[<i>In his speech is a barbarousness,</i> or <i>a vitiousness,</i>
or <i>an impediment,</i> &amp;c.]. (TA.)

